# 天朝循环大修·朋党：立场辩论侧栏（复制自原版加冕礼 coronation_supporter_detractor_widget，改为拥护/反对两栏）
widget = {
	name = "hd_party_debate_widget"
	datacontext = "[Activity.GetCurrentPhase]"
	datacontext = "[Activity.GetCurrentPhase.GetPhase]"
	# Visible for either the coronation-style (supporter/detractor) or the ecumenical-council-style (innovator/conservative) guest subsets.
	visible = "[Or( Or( DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_oppose' ) ) ), Or( DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'innovator' ) ), DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'conservative' ) ) ) )]"
	visible_at_creation = no # required to make sure we trigger the '_show' state
	size = { 275 700 }

	state = {
		name = _show
		using = Animation_FadeIn_Quick
	}

	state = {
		name = _hide
		using = Animation_FadeOut_Quick
	}

	vbox = {
		layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
		layoutpolicy_vertical = expanding
		
		background = {
			texture = "gfx/interface/component_tiles/tile_window_background_subwindow.dds"
			spriteType = Corneredtiled
			spriteborder = { 18 18 }
			margin = { 16 16 }
			texture_density = 2

			modify_texture = {
				name = "overlay"
				texture = "gfx/interface/component_overlay/overlay_effect.dds"
				spriteType = Corneredstretched
				spriteborder = { 0 0 }
				blend_mode = overlay
			}
		}

		### CORONATIONS
		vbox = {
			visible = "[Or( DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_oppose' ) ) )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding

			hd_party_vbox_coronations_supporter = {
				visible = "[DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) )]"
			}

			expand = {}

			hd_party_vbox_coronations_detractor = {
				visible = "[DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_oppose' ) )]"
			}
		}

		### ECUMENICAL COUNCIL
		vbox = {
			visible = "[Or( DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'innovator' ) ), DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'conservative' ) ) )]"

			hd_party_widget_ecumenical_innovator = {}

			hd_party_widget_ecumenical_conservative = {}
		}
	}
}

types HdPartySupporterWidget
{
	type hd_party_vbox_coronations_supporter = vbox {
		layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding

		hbox = {
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			margin = { 0 5 }

			hbox = {
				layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding

				### TITLE SUPPORTERS
				text_single = {
					layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
					text = "HD_DEBATE_SUPPORT_LABEL"
					using = Font_Type_Flavor
					fontsize = 22
					fontsize_min = 16
					default_format = "#high;glow_color:{0.1,0.1,0.1,1.0}"
					autoresize = yes
					align = nobaseline|hcenter
					margin_left = 10
					tooltip = "HD_DEBATE_SUPPORT_LABEL_HOVER"
				}

				background = {
					using = Mask_Rough_Edges
					alpha = 0.8
					margin = { 2 5 }

					texture = "gfx/interface/component_tiles/tile_title_bg_01.dds"
					spriteType = Corneredtiled
					spriteborder = { 40 8 }
					texture_density = 2

					modify_texture = {
						name = "mask"
						texture = "gfx/interface/component_masks/mask_fade_horizontal.dds"
						spriteType = Corneredstretched
						spriteborder = { 0 0 }
						blend_mode = alphamultiply
						mirror = horizontal
					}
				}
			}

			background = {
				tintcolor = { 0.7 0.8 1 0.8 }
				texture = "gfx/interface/colors/blue.dds"

				using = Mask_Rough_Edges

				modify_texture = {
					texture = "gfx/interface/component_masks/mask_fade_horizontal_short.dds"
					blend_mode = alphaMultiply
					alpha = 0.5
				}
			}
		}

		# 3 Supporters or More
		coronation_widget_types_3 = {
			name = "coronation_supporter_view_3"
			visible = "[GreaterThan_int32( GetDataModelSize( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), '(int32)2' )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding

			state = {
				name = _show
				trigger_when = "[DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) )]"
				on_start = "[ActivityWindow.SetAllPhasesGuestSubsetSortingDescending( 'hd_debate_support', 'hd_party_debate_sort_value' )]"
			}

			blockoverride "first_place_datacontext"
			{
				# Uses a bit of a hack to ensure the datacontext is updated
				# when the underlying datamodel is sorted.
				datamodel = "[DataModelFirst( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ), '(int32)1' )]"
			}
			blockoverride "second_place_datacontext"
			{
				## Uses a bit of a hack to ensure the datacontext is updated
				## when the underlying datamodel is sorted.
				datamodel = "[DataModelFirst( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ), '(int32)2' )]"
			}
			blockoverride "third_place_datacontext"
			{
				## Uses a bit of a hack to ensure the datacontext is updated
				## when the underlying datamodel is sorted.
				datamodel = "[DataModelFirst( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ), '(int32)3' )]"
			}
		}

		# 2 Supporters
		coronation_widget_types_2 = {
			name = "coronation_supporter_view_2"
			visible = "[EqualTo_int32( GetDataModelSize( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), '(int32)2' )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding

			state = {
				name = _show
				trigger_when = "[DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) )]"
				on_start = "[ActivityWindow.SetAllPhasesGuestSubsetSortingDescending( 'hd_debate_support', 'hd_party_debate_sort_value' )]"
			}

			blockoverride "first_place_datacontext"
			{
				# Uses a bit of a hack to ensure the datacontext is updated
				# when the underlying datamodel is sorted.
				datamodel = "[DataModelFirst( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ), '(int32)1' )]"
			}
			blockoverride "second_place_datacontext"
			{
				## Uses a bit of a hack to ensure the datacontext is updated
				## when the underlying datamodel is sorted.
				datamodel = "[DataModelFirst( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ), '(int32)2' )]"
			}
		}

		# 1 Supporter
		coronation_widget_types_1 = {
			name = "coronation_supporter_view_1"
			visible = "[EqualTo_int32( GetDataModelSize( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), '(int32)1' )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding

			state = {
				name = _show
				trigger_when = "[DataModelHasItems( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) )]"
				on_start = "[ActivityWindow.SetAllPhasesGuestSubsetSortingDescending( 'hd_debate_support', 'hd_party_debate_sort_value' )]"
			}

			blockoverride "first_place_datacontext"
			{
				# Uses a bit of a hack to ensure the datacontext is updated
				# when the underlying datamodel is sorted.
				datamodel = "[DataModelFirst( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ), '(int32)1' )]"
			}
		}

		# 0 Supporters
		coronation_widget_types_0 = {
			name = "coronation_supporter_view_0"
			visible = "[EqualTo_int32( GetDataModelSize( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), '(int32)0' )]"
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
		}

		# 1+ Other Supporters
		text_label_center = {
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			visible = "[GreaterThan_int32( GetDataModelSize( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), '(int32)3' )]"
			text = "HD_DEBATE_SUPPORT_OTHER_LABEL"
			default_format = "#UND"
			fontsize = 14
			fontsize_min = 10
			tooltip = "HD_DEBATE_SUPPORT_OTHER_HOVER"
		}

		# 0 Other Supporters
		text_label_center = {
			layoutpolicy_horizontal = expanding
			visible = "[LessThanOrEqualTo_int32( GetDataModelSize( ActivityWindow.GetCurrentPhaseGuestSubset( 'hd_debate_support' ) ), '(int32)3' )]"
			text = "HD_DEBATE_SUPPORT_OTHER_NONE"
			default_format = "#UND"
			fontsize = 14
			fontsize_min = 10
			tooltip = "HD_DEBATE_SUPPORT_OTHER_HOVER"
		}
	}

	type hd_party_vbox_coronations_detractor = vbox {
